<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Valero EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Valero EPS view cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers cut its 1996 earnings per share estimate on Valero Energy Corp to $1.20 from $1.70, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Lehman cut its 1997 EPS view to $1.80 from $2.05, the source said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Valero shares were unchanged at 21-1/8.</p>
</text>
